EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} I love visiting your
house.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} No matter how you decorate,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
it always feels welcoming.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}},{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} evine gelmeyi çok
seviyorum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Nasıl döşersen döşe,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
burası hep sıcak ve davetkâr geliyor.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Ich hoffe, ich darf mir ein paar
Notizen zu deinem Haus machen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Deine Raumaufteilung ist prima!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}¡Ay, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}debería haberte traído algún
detallito por dejarme estar aquí!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Siento ser tan despistada{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Oh ! Je voulais t'apporter un cadeau
pour te remercier de m'accueillir...{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Ça m'est sorti de la tête, désolée !

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0010:}}Ich hätte dir eigentlich ein kleines
Gastgeschenk mitbringen sollen.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}
Tut mir leid, ich hab's verschwitzt!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}It's a little embarrassing for me{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
knowing that you're inspecting
everything in my room.

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Well{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.it's not much,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} but it's home.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I've tried to do little things here and
there to make it comfortable.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Das ist mein bescheidenes Zuhause.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich habe versucht, es möglichst
wohnlich einzurichten.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Şey{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.pek gösterişli değil,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ama yuvam burası.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Rahat olsun diye şurada burada küçük
dokunuşlar yapmaya çalıştım.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}I hope it's not too cluttered!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
I should have tidied up before
having company over.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Sono désolée per tutto il disordine!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Avrei dovuto mettere un po'
a posto, ma non ho avuto tempo...

FR:
Je vous ai préparé des cookies :{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
bousculez-vous,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} y'en aura pas pour
tout le monde !

DE:
Ich habe zwar Plätzchen gebacken,
{{TAG:0003:000A:}}aber leider nicht genug für alle.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Ich hoffe, ihr seid nicht böse.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}L'ultima volta che ho avuto ospiti,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ho organizzato un entusiasmante
torneo di rubamazzetto!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Letztes Mal, als ich so viele Gäste
hatte, haben wir Blindekuh gespielt.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das war richtig lustig!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Evime en son bu kadar kişi geldiğinde{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
eşek oynayıp durmuştuk. Çok
çekişmeli geçmişti!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Me lo estoy pasando muy bien
contigo y con {{TAG:0011:0001:0000}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
¡Y mañana podríamos ir a mi casa!

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}May I have your attention,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} please?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Thank you for gathering here today.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Since we don't already have plans,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
why don't we take a moment to
discuss possible play schedules?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Dikkatinizi rica edebilir miyim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} lütfen?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bugün burada toplandığınız
için teşekkürler.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Madem önceden yapılmış
bir planımız yok,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
oyun programımızı konuşmaya ne dersiniz?

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Please{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} make yourself at home!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Having all these friends inside my
house makes it feel like a party.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Bitte macht es euch gemütlich!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Heute habe ich so viele Gäste, da
bin ich richtig in Feierlaune!

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Lütfen{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} kendi evinizmiş gibi rahat edin!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Bunca arkadaşım evde olunca sanki
parti varmış gibi hissediyorum.
